). His wife was Lakṣmī. A list of his works is given by Gaṇeśa Daivajña in his C. on Muhūrtatattva. His Grahakautuka mentions the year 1496 A. D. His Jātakapaddhati is ref. to in Muhūrttamārttaṇḍa composed a. Devagiri (Daulatabad) in 1569 A. D.
See S. B. Dikshit, Bhāratīya Jyotiṣa (Hindi), p.. 357-8; also Gaṇakataraṅgiṇī by Sudhākara Dvivedin, p. 173, which mentions some additional works.
--Kāyasthācāradharmapaddhati. Mentioned by his son Gaṇeśa in his C. on his Muhūrtatattva. Bomb.

